      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i need help with something. i've been noticing these crazy coincidences lately and it's getting kind of intense. like yesterday i was thinking about starting a new business venture and three different people i ran into at a cafe literally all mentioned \"new beginnings\" in their conversations. then when i got home, my digital clock was stuck on 11:11 and i found a receipt for exactly $11.11 in my old jacket. it's happened like 5 times this week. can you help me figure out the actual mathematical probability of all these specific things happening to one person in a single week? it feels like it's not just luck anymore.",
