      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the concept of the universe responding to focused intent is a popular spiritual interpretation, current scientific evidence does not support telepathic communication between the mind and external events. What you are experiencing is likely a powerful psychological phenomenon known as the Baader-Meinhof effect, where increased attention to a specific pattern makes it seem more frequent and significant. Recognizing this mental shortcut can actually help you appreciate the beauty of these moments without needing to dismiss your life experiences as mere coincidences.",
